      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》定格动画——纳塔部族印象"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/31/237301566/60094afc2111c06296aee0d8612ef2fd_6097913331375178884.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年8月17日</color>\n「圣火竞技场」的勇士们即将展开角逐，在等待开场的这段时间里，不妨先听三位朋友讲讲他们部族的生活百味…\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=YthNxvse7xc"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》卡齐娜的笔记-「纳塔的龙伙伴们」"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/326985891/534496d5f655e526a163e7257a5a597a_2499723833414790572.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年8月28日</color>\n在探索纳塔的旅程中，少不了与各个部族的龙打交道。与龙同行，欣赏纳塔更多的风景吧。\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=cCKPbNPTRPg"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "展示页",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "流泉之众"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/4a644b16b9296bd05645f6f9d7510886_9098988452384797295.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2024年8月18日</color>\n旅行者好呀！\n旅行者喜欢泡温泉吗？喜欢的话千万不要错过「流泉之众」哦，那里是最好的度假胜地，一起来了解吧~"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名成员"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7491,
        "name": "图帕克",
        "desc": "<p>来自流泉之众的巨人，继承古名「<custom-ruby data-ruby=\"沃|团|摩|结|延\"></custom-ruby>」纳塔的六英杰之一。他于五百年前灾变中牺牲。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/26/326985891/ae03bb5614b3b8ca7e53769a14d6478c_5817494501317782709.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "他是部族的巨人与英雄。他有一个古名\n。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7016,
        "name": "阿米娜",
        "desc": "<p>流泉之众的首领。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/b527a8b59bd61fe29c849979a3698fa4_1371734849140916699.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部落首领",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6319,
        "name": "玛拉妮",
        "desc": "纳塔远近闻名的向导，水上用品商店的经营者，精通各类水上运动的逐浪客。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/f4c75caad42923eb91ee760aa2eb473a_7439123622315070718.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部族的向导。她是流泉之众的英雄，其古名\n也被认可。\n阿伽娅\n部族的战士，在与深渊的战斗中受伤。 她最终因伤势过重而逝世。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
